/**
 * Shared design tokens for the lead status system (MOBILE_DESIGN_SPEC section 2).
 *
 * Three parallel maps must stay in lockstep:
 *   getStageColor    -> the badge chip classes
 *   getStageGradient -> the card background wash + border
 *   getStatusAccent  -> the solid hex driving blooms, rings and bars
 *
 * Every class string is written out in full. Never compose them
 * (`text-${hue}-500` is never generated by the Tailwind JIT).
 */

